[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22086.43, "timestamp": "06:08:06", "text": "什么？别再胡思乱想了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22090.03, "timestamp": "06:08:10", "text": "巴。我的意思是，我的意思是，你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22094.19, "timestamp": "06:08:14", "text": "我是一个容易表达的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22096.708, "timestamp": "06:08:16", "text": "猜测。我该如何写诗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22098.51, "timestamp": "06:08:18", "text": "关于我自己的愚蠢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22101.27, "timestamp": "06:08:21", "text": "生活？但你却总能把一切都变成现实。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22104.15, "timestamp": "06:08:24", "text": "你的人生是一场冒险。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22106.43, "timestamp": "06:08:26", "text": "即使是小的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22109.788, "timestamp": "06:08:29", "text": "诸如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22117.99, "timestamp": "06:08:37", "text": "那。所以，嗯，我想说的就是这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22121.43, "timestamp": "06:08:41", "text": "我感觉更多了，我感觉更强烈了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22125.07, "timestamp": "06:08:45", "text": "通过你，我比通过我更能通过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22128.99, "timestamp": "06:08:48", "text": "我。我们也有那种奇怪的现象。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22131.03, "timestamp": "06:08:51", "text": "联系。这是你自己的错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22134.03, "timestamp": "06:08:54", "text": "在我的生意中，所有"}]